From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: himax-hx83121a: swap the panel's width and height
 in mm

Both panel descriptions give width_mm = 266 and height_mm = 166, but
their modes are 1600x2560: the 266 mm side is the one with 2560 pixels.
DSI panels have no EDID, so userspace takes the size from the connector.
drm_hwcomposer computes the DPI from the width alone, as hdisplay * 25.4 /
width_mm, and reported about 153 dpi for a panel of about 245 dpi
(0.1038 mm per pixel).

Swap the two values for both panels.

Fixes: a7c61963b727 ("drm/panel: Add Himax HX83121A panel driver")
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83121a.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83121a.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83121a.c
index 440099533d..9fc4f82a83 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83121a.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx83121a.c
@@ -777,8 +777,8 @@ static void himax_remove(struct mipi_dsi_device *dsi)
 
 /* Model name: BOE PPC357DB1-4 */
 static const struct panel_desc boe_ppc357db1_4_desc = {
-	.width_mm = 266,
-	.height_mm = 166,
+	.width_mm = 166,
+	.height_mm = 266,
 	.lanes = 4,
 	.bpc = 8,
 	.format = MIPI_DSI_FMT_RGB888,
@@ -797,8 +797,8 @@ static const struct panel_desc boe_ppc357db1_4_desc = {
 
 /* Model name: CSOT PPC357DB1-4 */
 static const struct panel_desc csot_ppc357db1_4_desc = {
-	.width_mm = 266,
-	.height_mm = 166,
+	.width_mm = 166,
+	.height_mm = 266,
 	.lanes = 4,
 	.bpc = 8,
 	.format = MIPI_DSI_FMT_RGB888,
